The reverse-representability rows depend on the primitive tuple as follows.

| Row | Required primitive data | Derived decision |
|---|---|---|
| amplitude | `U_eta9`, `W9^tau` | transformed cohomology concentrated in the claimed bundle degrees |
| local freeness | `U_eta9`, `W9^tau` | locally free ranks 3 and 9 |
| topology | `U_eta9`, `W9^tau` | determinant, Chern and twist rows |
